@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070
@tripId = 5

### 1. Kontrollér at serveren kører — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### 2. Login — forvent 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.clear("token");

    if (response.status === 200) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    }
%}


### 3. Se den bruger, der er logget ind — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Søg efter destinationer i Norge — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinations?search=Norge


### 5. Se mine gemte rejser — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. Se rejseplan og budget — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. Se rejsens aktiviteter — forvent 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. Se vejret i Oslo — forvent 200, kræver eksternt API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/destinations/OSL


### 9. Adgang uden token — forvent 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me


### 10. Ugyldigt rejse-ID — forvent 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Forkert datatype ved login — forvent 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {
    "forkert": "datatype"
  },
  "password": "Test12345!"
}


### 12. Forkert datatype for pris — forvent 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/activities/custom
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testaktivitet",
  "date": "2026-11-22",
  "time": "12:00",
  "priceAmount": "hej",
  "category": "Test",
  "notes": ""
}